            <note corresp="#d440-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d440-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, UN 22–2 CHICOM.
                    Confidential. Text received from the White House; cleared by Armitage, Jenkins,
                    Eliot, Under Secretary Johnson, and Winthrop G. Brown; and approved by Assistant
                    Secretary De Palma. Repeated to Taipei, Tokyo, Canberra, and Wellington.</p>
            </note>
